  [PASS] C2 the Green's function identity: (omega^2 - c_s^2 k^2 + 2i eps omega) G_R = 1 for the retarded sound propagator   worst |(operator)G - 1| = 3.26e-23 -- G_R = 1/((omega+i eps)^2 - c_s^2 k^2) is the exact Green's function of the committed perturbation operator d_t^2 - c_s^2 Lap
  [PASS] C3 the pole sits EXACTLY at omega = c_s k = sigma k (the Goldstone sound branch, B8): denominator zero at every tested wavenumber   max |omega^2 - c_s^2 k^2| at omega = c_s k = 1.8e-46 -- omega = sigma k identically: the response's only pole is the sound mode
