  [PASS] C8 the FDT weight is concentrated ON the Goldstone branch: >= 95% of the spectrum within +-20eps of omega = sigma k (a delta-fine doublet)   on-branch fraction 0.968212, off-branch 3.18e-02 -- no off-branch spectral weight: the committed spectrum is the pure sound doublet; a measured continuum/central peak would be a kill (V3)
    full-line integral int_{-150a}^{150a} S d omega (eps = 1e-2 a) = 1.946459e-53
