  [PASS] C10 the spectrum amplitude is fixed by the committed mass and equilibrium: pi m rho_0(r) with m = 5.09 keV, rho_0 = A/r^2   pi m rho_0(r_M) = 9.7323e-54 kg^2/m^3; at r_break = 2.5318e-53 -- no free parameter: the amplitude scales as rho_0 ~ 1/r^2 with the G084 profile coefficient
    C(k, t)/m rho_0 at t = 0.00 pi/(sigma k):  numeric 0.997879  exact cos = 1.000000
